#
# --- Canillo (AD-02) / La Massana (AD-04) / Ordino (AD-05) / Sant Julià de
#     Lòria (AD-06) / Andorra la Vella (AD-07) / Escaldes-Engordany (AD-08):
#     vacanza/holidays 0.101 (MIT) holidays/countries/andorra.py -- each
#     parish's patron/foundation day. Multi-day "Festa Major" festivals and
#     the movable Diada de Canòlich / Diada de la creació de la parròquia
#     are decree-tabulated 2024-2025 (not stable single-day fixed rules).
#     AD-03 (Encamp) carries no subdivision-specific holiday in vacanza and
#     is omitted.
